@AmazonHelp Yes, been around this loop several times now with junk/spam, only email received had a number of suspicious errors (all documented to you), and advised not to follow the instructions.

Only 'feedback' has been 'we will be in touch' for &gt;2 weeks.

So when should I give up?

@AmazonHelp I'm a Prime user and was guaranteed delivery by 8 PM yesterday.
I was messaged my order was delivered but it wasn't
I recieved it now 1/2

@AmazonHelp @368322 pls deliver to nathan instead

